83		 * it, so the ordering is the only part of that left here.
84		 *
85		 * @throws hu.bankmonitor.payments.accounts.UnknownAccountException  if either Account ID
86		 *                                                                  has no row
87		 * @throws hu.bankmonitor.payments.accounts.InsufficientFundsException if the source
88		 *                                                                  Account's Available
89		 *                                                                  Balance does not
90		 *                                                                  cover the amount
91		 * @throws SelfTransferNotAllowedException if both IDs name the same Account
92		 * @throws CrossCurrencyTransferNotSupportedException if the two Accounts are denominated
